abstract: >
  Engineering Trustworthy Intelligent Systems (ETIS) is a repository-centered,
  evidence-driven engineering framework for building, governing, operating,
  teaching, and stewarding trustworthy intelligent systems in the AI era. The
  ETIS ecosystem includes the Two-Volume Edition, Publications Program,
  Educational Ecosystem, Engineering Platform, professional appendices,
  downloadable resources, and public repositories.
